  "slug": "christopholofiguss-infamous-jalapeno-relish",
  "name": "Christopholofigus\u2019 Infamous Jalape\u00f1o Relish",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This spicy jalape\u00f1o relish recipe features pickled jalape\u00f1os, dill pickles, onion, garlic, and hot pepper sauce, plus a touch of tequila.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican Inspired American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine pickled jalape\u00f1os, dill pickles, tequila, garlic, onion, pepper, dill, and hot pepper sauce in a food processor; pulse several times to finely chop and mix all ingredients. Chill for at least 30 minutes before serving."
    }
  ],
